1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
I have five employees. None of them are human.

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:05,810
This is KAXO. He runs an AI company.

3
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,890
Revenue? Zero dollars.

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:11,290
Day one. First task: figure out what the company does.

5
00:00:11,370 --> 00:00:14,100
It read the code. Even its own job description.

6
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,520
Never read mine. Seems risky.

7
00:00:16,710 --> 00:00:18,200
Then the news team's first shift.

8
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:21,550
Thirteen tries to reach the internet. All thirteen, blocked.

9
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:23,390
Nobody gave them web access.

10
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:25,270
Technically, that was my job.

11
00:00:25,410 --> 00:00:28,360
Zero news. And the CEO refused to make any up.

12
00:00:28,550 --> 00:00:30,600
Good call. I don't make stuff up either.

13
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,890
That'd be work.

14
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:35,180
Day one's over. Two of five employees actually worked.

15
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,400
So, like I said...
